From 9f88786822450c0ad7653a3b7f96cf42e4a2e028 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:46:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix installSplashScreen import: needs explicit .Companion.
 segment

androidx.core.splashscreen.SplashScreen.installSplashScreen (previous
commit, omitting Companion) still left it unresolved in CI - Kotlin
does not let you skip the explicit Companion qualifier when importing
a function declared inside a companion object, even though the
metalava API listing makes it look reachable straight off the class
name. Verified the correct form against three independent working
Kotlin samples that use this exact library and call site:

    import androidx.core.splashscreen.SplashScreen.Companion.installSplashScreen

The call site was already correct (bare installSplashScreen()) and is
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0117Yza2cLL621d3pHBjry2q
---
 .../app/src/main/java/zw/co/eduquinn/app/ui/NativeActivity.kt   | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/EduQuinn-Android-Build-Ready/EduQuinn-Android/app/src/main/java/zw/co/eduquinn/app/ui/NativeActivity.kt b/EduQuinn-Android-Build-Ready/EduQuinn-Android/app/src/main/java/zw/co/eduquinn/app/ui/NativeActivity.kt
index fb0d9d1..a6b6cad 100644
--- a/EduQuinn-Android-Build-Ready/EduQuinn-Android/app/src/main/java/zw/co/eduquinn/app/ui/NativeActivity.kt
+++ b/EduQuinn-Android-Build-Ready/EduQuinn-Android/app/src/main/java/zw/co/eduquinn/app/ui/NativeActivity.kt
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ import androidx.compose.material3.Surface
 import androidx.compose.runtime.collectAsState
 import androidx.compose.runtime.getValue
 import androidx.compose.ui.Modifier
-import androidx.core.splashscreen.SplashScreen.installSplashScreen
+import androidx.core.splashscreen.SplashScreen.Companion.installSplashScreen
 import androidx.lifecycle.lifecycleScope
 import kotlinx.coroutines.launch
 import zw.co.eduquinn.app.EduQuinnApplication
